    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# PageIndex Workflow for Knowledge Base - Update\n\n## Purpose\nMirrors a knowledge-base file update from Pinecone into PageIndex. Removes the previous PageIndex copy of the document and re-uploads the latest version so chatbot retrieval never serves stale answers from PageIndex.\n\n## How it works\n- Receives `fileId` + `fileName` from the caller\n- Lists all PageIndex documents and finds the existing entry by fuzzy-matching the file's base name\n- If a matching doc exists, deletes it via the PageIndex API (errors are tolerated so a missing doc does not block the update)\n- Copies the source Drive file as a temporary Google Doc, exports it as PDF, and multipart-uploads the PDF to the PageIndex `/doc/` endpoint\n- Extracts the new `doc_id`, upserts the PageIndex_File_Tracker row (status = updated), and deletes the temporary Google Doc\n\n## Triggered by\nExecute Workflow trigger  invoked as a sub-workflow with `fileId` + `fileName`.\n\n## Called by\n- RAG Workflow for Knowledge Base - Update\n\n## Reads/writes\n- Reads from and writes to Google Drive (creates a temp Google Doc copy, exports as PDF, deletes the temp copy)\n- Calls the PageIndex API (lists docs, deletes the old doc, uploads the new one)\n- Upserts Google Sheets `Customer_Support_Data`  `PageIndex_File_Tracker`",
        "height": 750,
        "width": 1100,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-overview-doc",
      "name": "Workflow Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1104,
        160
      ]
    }
